  "summary": "A flowing chain: roll over with crossed ankles, switch the cross, roll up to a balanced V, sweep the arms behind and fold forward over the legs.",
  "steps": [
    "Sit tall with legs long and one ankle crossed over the other, hands by the hips.",
    "Roll back, taking the legs overhead; uncross and recross the ankles the other way.",
    "Roll up to balance in a V, arms reaching forward.",
    "Sweep the arms behind, clasp the hands and lift them as the legs lower and the body folds forward.",
    "Circle the arms round to the feet and roll up to sitting."
  ],
  "layers": [
    {
